# TAB 5: FIXED ASSETS

### Capex

```excel
=Revenue*6%
```

---

### Depreciation

```excel
=Capex*40%
```

---

# TAB 6: CASH FLOW

## EBIT

```excel
=EBITDA-Depreciation
```

---

## Taxes

```excel
=MAX(0,EBIT*TaxRate)
```

---

## NOPAT

```excel
=EBIT-Taxes
```

---

## UFCF

```excel
=NOPAT
+Depreciation
-Capex
-ChangeNWC
```

---

# TAB 7: DCF

### Discount Factor

```excel
=1/(1+WACC)^Year
```

---

## Present Value

```excel
=UFCF*DiscountFactor
```

---

## Terminal Value

```excel
=(FCF10*(1+g))/(WACC-g)
```

---

## PV Terminal

```excel
=TerminalValue/(1+WACC)^10
```

---

## Enterprise Value

```excel
=SUM(PV_FCF)+PV_Terminal
```

