---

### Treasury Stock Method

Assume:

```text
Share Price = Dynamic
Strike = $12
Options = 142.5M
```

Incremental Shares:

```excel
=Options*(SharePrice-StrikePrice)/SharePrice
```

---

Example:

```text
Share Price = $34
```

Result:

```text
≈92M Incremental Shares
```

